Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - Have had one prior platinum-based chemotherapy regimen for the treatment of primary disease. 
 - At least 4 weeks since last surgery [OR] or radiation therapy. 
 - Must have had a treatment- [NOT] free interval of greater than 6 months following response to platinum. 
 - ECOG performance status of 0,1, or 2.
