ng. \n  -  Have characteristics contraindicating metformin [OR] or sulfonylurea use. \n  -  Have been treated with exogenous insulin for more than 1 week within the 3 months prior to screening. \n  -  Have used drugs for weight loss within 1 month of screening.<|eot_id|>']
