 Criteria:\nPatients who have taken either morphine [AND] with daily dose more than 120mg or Fentanyl [AND] with daily dose more than 50ug/hr \nExclusion Criteria:\nPatients with significant abnormalities in hepatic [OR] or renal function which would, in the opinion of the investigator, [NOT] prevent the patients involvement in the study \nPatients with significant clinical abnormalities in CNS, [OR] respiratory [OR] or cardiovascular function, which in the investigators judgement [NOT] prevents participation in the study \nPatients who have taken antidepressants [OR] or anti-epileptic drugs, [OR] sedative hypnotics, [OR] selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor, [OR] short-acting analgesics, [OR] topical medications [OR] and/or anesthetics [OR] and/or muscle relaxants when taking Tramadol/ [OR] Acetaminophen<|eot_id|>']
