ing the study [OR] or in the future \nWith a elevated post-void residual (defined as PVR > 100cc) \nWith a bleeding condition [OR] or on anti-coagulant therapy \nWith immunosuppression (i.e. HIV, [OR] lymphoma) \nWith multiple sclerosis [OR] or other progressive neurological disease \nWith evidence of a local [OR] or systemic infection, including urinary tract infection \nWith evidence of intrinsic sphincter deficiency as defined by a maximal urethral closure pressure of <20 cm H2O \nPrevious sub-urethral sling \nPredominant overactive bladder symptoms<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
  -  Patients: 
Exclusion Criteria:
Who are pregnant [OR] or planning to become pregnant during the study [OR] or in the future 
With a elevated post-void residual (defined as PVR > 100cc) 
With a bleeding condition [OR] or on anti-coagulant therapy 
With immunosuppression (i.e. HIV, [OR] lymphoma) 
With multiple sclerosis [OR] or other progressive neurological disease 
With evidence of a local [OR] or systemic infection, including urinary tract infection 
With evidence of intrinsic sphincter deficiency as defined by a maximal urethral closure pressure of <20 cm H2O 
Previous sub-urethral sling 
Predominant overactive bladder symptoms
