Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nPatients with T2DM and CAS as defined below: \nClinical definitions \nT2DM: Diagnosed according to the WHO criteria [53]. \nCAD:Presence of any one of the following: Angina plus positive exercise tolerance test, enzyme and/or Q wave positive myocardial infarction, angiographic evidence ( >50% stenosis of one vessel), percutaneous or surgical coronary revascularisation. \nAged between 18 and 75 \nProvided written consent for participation in the trial prior to any study-specific procedures or requirements. \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nPatients with T2DM [AND] and CAS as defined below: \nClinical definitions \nT2DM: Diagnosed according to the WHO criteria [53]. \nCAD:Presence of any one of the following: Angina [AND] plus positive exercise tolerance test, [OR] enzyme [OR] and/or Q wave positive myocardial infarction, [OR] angiographic evidence  ( >50% stenosis of one vessel), percutaneous [OR] or surgical coronary revascularisation. \nAged between 18 and 75 \nProvided written consent for participation in the trial prior to any study-specific procedures or requirements.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Patients with T2DM [AND] and CAS as defined below: 
Clinical definitions 
T2DM: Diagnosed according to the WHO criteria [53]. 
CAD:Presence of any one of the following: Angina [AND] plus positive exercise tolerance test, [OR] enzyme [OR] and/or Q wave positive myocardial infarction, [OR] angiographic evidence  ( >50% stenosis of one vessel), percutaneous [OR] or surgical coronary revascularisation. 
Aged between 18 and 75 
Provided written consent for participation in the trial prior to any study-specific procedures or requirements.
